# Package profiles: a name, a colon, then the groups it installs, in order.
# Groups are the <group>.Brewfile files in this directory. Every profile lists
# core first because bootstrap needs it. Profiles never list packages.
#
# Select one with `bootstrap.sh --profile <name>` (default: full), then adjust
# it with `--with <group>[,<group>]` and `--without <group>[,<group>]`.
# Groups not named by any profile, such as creative, install only via --with.
slim: core dev utilities
full: core dev utilities ai dev-extras media network desktop personal
